does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_pc=grandpup f7_chain=pc} Bring #other.child# round on Restday. I've saved the honey. | {f7_pc=grandpup f7_chain=pc} #other.child# has your ears. And mine, come to that. | {f7_pc=grandpup f7_chain=pc} Is #other.child# eating properly? You never did. | {f7_pc=grandpup f7_chain=pc} I've a story for #other.child#. A long one, with a bear in it.
then other: family.answer_parent

rule f7_pc_adult_widowed
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent pair.elder=a self.stage=old self.widowed=yes
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_pc=lonely f7_chain=pc} I set out two cups again this morning. | {f7_pc=lonely f7_chain=pc} The bed's too big. Isn't that silly? | {f7_pc=lonely f7_chain=pc} I keep saving them the warm side of the fire. | {f7_pc=lonely f7_chain=pc} I found their old tin whistle in the chest. I can't play it. I keep it anyway.
then other: family.answer_parent

rule f7_pc_adult_hurt
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent pair.elder=a self.stage=old self.injured=light|bad
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {f7_pc=hurt f7_chain=pc} My hip's playing up. Don't make a face. | {f7_pc=hurt f7_chain=pc} I took a tumble on the step. It's nothing. It's something. | {f7_pc=hurt f7_chain=pc} The healer says rest. I say rubbish. | {f7_pc=hurt f7_chain=pc} I can't get down the stairs without the rail now. There. I've said it.
then other: family.answer_parent

rule f7_pc_adult_help
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent pair.elder=a self.wealth=rich|comfortable other.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {f7_pc=help f7_chain=pc} Let me help with the rent. Don't argue. | {f7_pc=help f7_chain=pc} I put something in your coat pocket. Don't look. | {f7_pc=help f7_chain=pc} There's a sack of meal by the door. It's yours. | {f7_pc=help f7_chain=pc} I've paid the cobbler for your boots. Go and fetch them.
then other: family.answer_parent

rule f7_pc_adult_unwed_son
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent pair.elder=a self.stage=old other.stage=adult other.married=no other.sex=male
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {f7_pc=match f7_chain=pc} Has anyone caught your eye? | {f7_pc=match f7_chain=pc} The miller's daughter asked after you. Asked twice. | {f7_pc=match f7_chain=pc} You can't marry your work, you know. | {f7_pc=match f7_chain=pc} There's a nice girl at chapel who laughs at everything. You could use that.
then other: family.answer_parent

rule f7_pc_adult_unwed_daughter
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent pair.elder=a self.stage=old other.stage=adult other.married=no other.sex=female
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {f7_pc=match f7_chain=pc} Has anyone caught your eye? | {f7_pc=match f7_chain=pc} The miller's son asked after you. Asked twice. | {f7_pc=match f7_chain=pc} You can't marry your work, you know. | {f7_pc=match f7_chain=pc} The cooper's boy has a good trade and all his teeth. Just saying.
then other: family.answer_parent

rule f7_pc_adult_fret
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent pair.elder=a self.stage=old other.stage=adult
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {f7_pc=fret f7_chain=pc} You look thin. Are you eating? | {f7_pc=fret f7_chain=pc} You never visit. You're here now. Never mind. | {f7_pc=fret f7_chain=pc} You work too hard. You get that from me. | {f7_pc=fret f7_chain=pc} Is that coat warm enough? It doesn't look warm enough.
then other: family.answer_parent

# =============================================================================================== Children to their parents
# The opener remembers what kind (conv.f7_cp), so the mother or father answers that (family.answer_child), and
# the son or daughter may have the last word on the tone of it (family.settle).

rule f7_cp_young_why
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=young other.stage=adult|old
does ask.detail
cooldown 1d
say {f7_cp=why f7_chain=cp} Why do we have tails? | {f7_cp=why f7_chain=cp} Where does the rain go after? | {f7_cp=why f7_chain=cp} Why do geese honk at nothing? | {f7_cp=why f7_chain=cp} Why can't I stay up? You stay up. | {f7_cp=why f7_chain=cp} Why do the old ones smell of cupboards?
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_young_little
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=young other.stage=adult|old
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {f7_cp=little f7_chain=cp} Were you ever little? Really little? | {f7_cp=little f7_chain=cp} What were you like when you were my size? | {f7_cp=little f7_chain=cp} Did you have a #gran# too? | {f7_cp=little f7_chain=cp} Did you ever get in trouble? Real trouble?
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_young_poor
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=young self.wealth=poor|destitute
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {f7_cp=poor f7_chain=cp} Are we poor? Brindle said we're poor. | {f7_cp=poor f7_chain=cp} Why don't I get new boots like the others? | {f7_cp=poor f7_chain=cp} Why do we only have bread? | {f7_cp=poor f7_chain=cp} Tam's family has meat every day. Every day!
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_young_hungry
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=young self.hungry=yes
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
priority 1
say {f7_cp=hungry f7_chain=cp} My belly's growling. Listen. | {f7_cp=hungry f7_chain=cp} Is there anything to eat? Anything? | {f7_cp=hungry f7_chain=cp} When's #supper#? Is it soon? Is it now? | {f7_cp=hungry f7_chain=cp} I'm so hungry I could eat a whole goose. With the feathers.
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_young_night
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=young here.time=night
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {f7_cp=fear f7_chain=cp} Can I sleep in your bed? There's a noise. | {f7_cp=fear f7_chain=cp} Leave the door open. A crack. A bigger crack. | {f7_cp=fear f7_chain=cp} Is there such a thing as the Fen Hag? Really? | {f7_cp=fear f7_chain=cp} Something's under my bed. It breathed.
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_young_grief
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=young self.mourning=kin
does ask.detail
cooldown 6h
priority 3
say {f7_cp=grief f7_chain=cp} Where did they go? Are they coming back? | {f7_cp=grief f7_chain=cp} Is it my fault? I was naughty that day. | {f7_cp=grief f7_chain=cp} Can I keep their scarf? | {f7_cp=grief f7_chain=cp} Will they still know me when I'm big?
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_young_rich
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=young self.wealth=rich
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {f7_cp=rich f7_chain=cp} Why can't I play by the river with the others? | {f7_cp=rich f7_chain=cp} The cook's pup says we're rich. Are we? What's rich? | {f7_cp=rich f7_chain=cp} Why do I have to go to dancing? The others don't. | {f7_cp=rich f7_chain=cp} Why does the stable pup get to have muddy paws and I don't?
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_young_merry
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=young self.humour=merry
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_cp=news f7_chain=cp} I've got a frog in my pocket. His name's Sir. | {f7_cp=news f7_chain=cp} I can whistle! Nearly. Listen. | {f7_cp=news f7_chain=cp} I told a joke at the well and everybody laughed. Even the old ones. | {f7_cp=news f7_chain=cp} I can make my ears go flat and up and flat. Look!
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_young_want
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=young
does request
cooldown 1d
say {f7_cp=want f7_chain=cp} Can I have a hen of my own? I'll feed it. | {f7_cp=want f7_chain=cp} Can I have a penny? I'll give it back. One day. | {f7_cp=want f7_chain=cp} I found a beetle. Can it live with us? | {f7_cp=want f7_chain=cp} Can I go and play at the well? Please?
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_young_news
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=young
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {f7_cp=news f7_chain=cp} When I'm big I'm going to be a guard. Or a baker. Or both. | {f7_cp=news f7_chain=cp} I found a stone with a hole in it. It's lucky. | {f7_cp=news f7_chain=cp} The baker's cat licked me. On the nose. | {f7_cp=news f7_chain=cp} I can count to a hundred. Nearly.
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_teen_leave
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=adolescent self.drive=restless|ambitious
does tell.plan
cooldown 3d
say {f7_cp=leave f7_chain=cp} I want to go and see the world. There's work out there. Real work. | {f7_cp=leave f7_chain=cp} I'm not a pup any more. I want to see something. Anything. | {f7_cp=leave f7_chain=cp} I'm going to leave one day. You know that, don't you? | {f7_cp=leave f7_chain=cp} The carters say there's places past the hills where nobody knows your name.
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_teen_room
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=adolescent self.quarter=sump
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {f7_cp=cramped f7_chain=cp} Can I not have a corner of my own? A curtain, even? | {f7_cp=cramped f7_chain=cp} I'm sick of sleeping four to a mattress. | {f7_cp=cramped f7_chain=cp} When I've money we're moving up the hill. All of us. | {f7_cp=cramped f7_chain=cp} I can hear everything through that wall. Everything.
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_apprentice
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.apprentice=yes other.stage=adult|old
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_cp=work f7_chain=cp} My master made me sweep the same floor three times. | {f7_cp=work f7_chain=cp} I made a thing today. A whole thing. It was crooked, but. | {f7_cp=work f7_chain=cp} I'm going to be better at it than my master one day. | {f7_cp=work f7_chain=cp} My master said "not bad" today. Not bad!
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_teen_want
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=adolescent
does ask.detail
cooldown 1d
say {f7_cp=want_teen f7_chain=cp} Can I borrow the good cloak? I'll be careful. | {f7_cp=want_teen f7_chain=cp} Everyone else gets to go to the dance. Everyone. | {f7_cp=want_teen f7_chain=cp} Can I stay at Fennick's tonight? Their mother says yes. | {f7_cp=want_teen f7_chain=cp} Can I have my own knife? A proper one?
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_teen_complain
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent self.stage=adolescent
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {f7_cp=sulk f7_chain=cp} You're embarrassing me. You're standing there embarrassingly. | {f7_cp=sulk f7_chain=cp} Why do you always ask where I'm going? | {f7_cp=sulk f7_chain=cp} You never let me do anything. | {f7_cp=sulk f7_chain=cp} Don't call me pup in front of people.
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_adult_care
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent pair.elder=b self.stage=adult other.stage=old
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_cp=care f7_chain=cp} You should come and live with us. There's room. | {f7_cp=care f7_chain=cp} Did you take what the healer gave you? | {f7_cp=care f7_chain=cp} Let me carry that. Please. Just let me. | {f7_cp=care f7_chain=cp} I'll do your roof on Restday. Don't argue.
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_adult_widowed
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent pair.elder=b self.stage=adult other.widowed=yes
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_cp=care_widowed f7_chain=cp} Have you eaten today? Properly? | {f7_cp=care_widowed f7_chain=cp} Come for #supper#. Every night, if you like. | {f7_cp=care_widowed f7_chain=cp} I miss them too. Every day. | {f7_cp=care_widowed f7_chain=cp} I walked past the old bench today. Their bench. I sat a while.
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_adult_richer
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent pair.elder=b self.stage=adult self.wealth=rich|comfortable other.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {f7_cp=help f7_chain=cp} I've paid your coal for the winter. It's done. Don't argue. | {f7_cp=help f7_chain=cp} Let me do this. You did everything for me. | {f7_cp=help f7_chain=cp} I'll not have you queuing for parish bread. Not while I've breath. | {f7_cp=help f7_chain=cp} I've a purse for you. Don't count it in front of me.
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_adult_news
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent pair.elder=b self.stage=adult self.child self.age<=36
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_cp=grandpup f7_chain=cp} #self.child# took a step today. Two steps! | {f7_cp=grandpup f7_chain=cp} #self.child# asked for you by name. | {f7_cp=grandpup f7_chain=cp} #self.child# bit the neighbour's pup. I don't know where that came from. Yes I do. | {f7_cp=grandpup f7_chain=cp} #self.child# drew you. You've four ears and a tail like a broom.
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_cp_adult_work
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=parent pair.elder=b self.stage=adult self.business=thriving|failing
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_cp=shop f7_chain=cp} The shop's had a month. I'll tell you about it. | {f7_cp=shop f7_chain=cp} I've been doing the books. I wish I'd listened when you showed me. | {f7_cp=shop f7_chain=cp} You always said trade was a fickle thing. You were right. | {f7_cp=shop f7_chain=cp} I need your advice. About the shop. Don't gloat.
then other: family.answer_child

# =============================================================================================== Brothers and sisters

rule f7_sib_mother
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=siblings self.stage=adult|old self.mother
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_share=our_mother f7_chain=share} Have you been to see #mum#? She says you haven't. | {f7_share=our_mother f7_chain=share} #mum.capitalize#'s sorted the attic. She found your drawings. | {f7_share=our_mother f7_chain=share} #mum.capitalize# asked me which of us is her favourite. I said you. To be kind. | {f7_share=our_mother f7_chain=share} #mum.capitalize#'s taken against the baker. Don't ask. Just don't buy his bread.
then other: family.share_answer

rule f7_sib_father_worry
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=siblings self.stage=adult|old self.father
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_worry=kin f7_chain=worry} #dad.capitalize#'s worse. He won't say, but he's worse. | {f7_worry=kin f7_chain=worry} Somebody should talk to #dad# about the stairs. Somebody meaning you. | {f7_worry=kin f7_chain=worry} #dad.capitalize# gave me his old knife. He's giving his things away. That's not like him. | {f7_worry=kin f7_chain=worry} #dad.capitalize# couldn't remember the way home from the well.
then other: family.worry_answer

rule f7_sib_richer
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=siblings self.stage=adult|old pair.richer=a
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {f7_share=offer f7_chain=share} If you're short, you only have to say. | {f7_share=offer f7_chain=share} I heard about your roof. Let me send someone. | {f7_share=offer f7_chain=share} You're too proud to ask. You always were. | {f7_share=offer f7_chain=share} There's a coat at mine that doesn't fit me. It'd fit you.
then other: family.share_answer

rule f7_sib_poorer
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=siblings self.stage=adult|old pair.richer=b
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {f7_tease=envy f7_chain=tease} Nice coat. New, is it? | {f7_tease=envy f7_chain=tease} I suppose you'll be too grand for us at the festival. | {f7_tease=envy f7_chain=tease} Could you... no. Never mind. | {f7_tease=envy f7_chain=tease} #mum.capitalize# always did say you'd go far. She didn't say you'd forget us.
then other: family.tease_answer

rule f7_sib_young
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=siblings self.stage=young|adolescent other.stage=young|adolescent
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {f7_tease=pups f7_chain=tease} I'm telling #mum#. | {f7_tease=pups f7_chain=tease} That's mine. I had it first. | {f7_tease=pups f7_chain=tease} You've got jam on your ear. | {f7_tease=pups f7_chain=tease} You smell like the goat. | {f7_tease=pups f7_chain=tease} You've been in my box. Don't lie.
then other: family.tease_answer

rule f7_sib_dare
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=siblings self.stage=young other.stage=young|adolescent
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_tease=dare f7_chain=tease} Bet you can't climb the wall. | {f7_tease=dare f7_chain=tease} I dare you to knock on old Marrow's door and run. | {f7_tease=dare f7_chain=tease} Race you to the well. Loser's a toad. | {f7_tease=dare f7_chain=tease} Bet you can't hold your breath till the cart's gone by.
then other: family.tease_answer

rule f7_sib_adult_memory
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=siblings self.stage=adult|old other.stage=adult|old
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {f7_share=sib_memory f7_chain=share} Remember when we hid in the woodpile and they called the watch? | {f7_share=sib_memory f7_chain=share} Do you remember the winter we had the one pair of boots between us? | {f7_share=sib_memory f7_chain=share} I passed the old house. Somebody's painted the door blue. | {f7_share=sib_memory f7_chain=share} Remember #dad#'s face when you brought the goat home?
then other: family.share_answer

rule f7_sib_adult_jibe
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=siblings self.stage=adult|old other.stage=adult|old
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_tease=jibe f7_chain=tease} You still owe me for the good bowl. | {f7_tease=jibe f7_chain=tease} You've gone grey at the muzzle. When did that happen? | {f7_tease=jibe f7_chain=tease} You've got #dad#'s laugh now. It's unsettling. | {f7_tease=jibe f7_chain=tease} You still eat like a pup. Elbows everywhere.
then other: family.tease_answer

rule f7_sib_mourning
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=siblings self.mourning=kin self.stage=adult|old
does tell.self
cooldown 6h
priority 3
say {f7_worry=grief f7_chain=worry} We're the old ones now, you and me. | {f7_worry=grief f7_chain=worry} I keep thinking of us as pups, all of us round the table. | {f7_worry=grief f7_chain=worry} Who's going to sort their things? I can't. I can't yet. | {f7_worry=grief f7_chain=worry} I went to tell them something today. Got halfway there.
then other: family.worry_answer

# =============================================================================================== Kin and the household

rule f7_hh_plain
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=household
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {f7_tease=chore f7_chain=tease} It was your turn on the water. Again. | {f7_tease=chore f7_chain=tease} Your snoring comes through the wall like a cart. | {f7_tease=chore f7_chain=tease} Somebody's been at my bread. I marked it. | {f7_tease=chore f7_chain=tease} You left the door on the latch all night.
then other: family.tease_answer

rule f7_hh_rent
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=household self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_worry=money f7_chain=worry} Have you got your share of the rent? I'm short myself. | {f7_worry=money f7_chain=worry} The landlord says he's raising it at the new month. | {f7_worry=money f7_chain=worry} If one of us goes, the other can't make the rent alone. | {f7_worry=money f7_chain=worry} I've sold my good knife for the rent. Don't ask me to do it again.
then other: family.worry_answer

rule f7_hh_sump
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=household self.quarter=sump
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {f7_tease=chore f7_chain=tease} The bucket's full again. Your turn to carry it down. | {f7_tease=chore f7_chain=tease} You used the last of the lamp oil. Again. | {f7_tease=chore f7_chain=tease} Your washing's dripping on my bed. | {f7_tease=chore f7_chain=tease} You let the rats in. Door wide open, half the night.
then other: family.tease_answer

rule f7_kin_old_young
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=family self.stage=old other.stage=young
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {f7_pc=story f7_chain=pc} Come and sit by me. I've a story for you. | {f7_pc=story f7_chain=pc} Shall I tell you what your father got up to at your age? Worse than you. | {f7_pc=story f7_chain=pc} Shall I tell you about the winter the river froze? | {f7_pc=story f7_chain=pc} Come here. I've a secret, and it's only for you.
then other: family.answer_parent

rule f7_kin_young_gran
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=family self.stage=young other.stage=old other.sex=female
does ask.detail
cooldown 1d
say {f7_cp=gran f7_chain=cp} #gran.capitalize#, tell me the one about the wolf in the well. | {f7_cp=gran f7_chain=cp} Can I have one of your sweets? The red ones? | {f7_cp=gran f7_chain=cp} #gran.capitalize#, can I sit on your lap? Just for a bit? | {f7_cp=gran f7_chain=cp} Can I brush your tail, #gran#? I'll be gentle.
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_kin_young_grandad
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=family self.stage=young other.stage=old other.sex=male
does ask.detail
cooldown 1d
say {f7_cp=gran f7_chain=cp} #grandad.capitalize#, tell me the one about the wolf in the well. | {f7_cp=gran f7_chain=cp} Can I have one of your sweets? The red ones? | {f7_cp=gran f7_chain=cp} #grandad.capitalize#, can I sit on your lap? Just for a bit? | {f7_cp=gran f7_chain=cp} Can I wear your hat, #grandad#? Just round the room?
then other: family.answer_child

rule f7_kin_festival
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=family self.stage=adult|old here.day!=festival
does ask.detail
cooldown 3d
say {f7_share=gathering f7_chain=share} Is your lot coming to us for the festival, or are we going to you? | {f7_share=gathering f7_chain=share} Who's having everyone this festival? I've done it twice running. | {f7_share=gathering f7_chain=share} Somebody has to have the whole family this festival. I had them last time. | {f7_share=gathering f7_chain=share} Where are we all eating at the festival? Somebody decide.
then other: family.share_answer

rule f7_kin_trouble
when concept=talk.family pair.kin=family self.stage=adult|old other.stage=adult|old
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {f7_share=kin_trouble f7_chain=share} Your brother still owes my brother a pig. | {f7_share=kin_trouble f7_chain=share} I heard about the trouble at yours. I hope it's sorted. | {f7_share=kin_trouble f7_chain=share} Our aunt's not speaking to your aunt. Again. Nobody knows why. | {f7_share=kin_trouble f7_chain=share} Somebody told Gran about the broken jug. It wasn't me. Mostly.
then other: family.share_answer

# =============================================================================================== Asking after each other's families (friends, acquaintances)

rule f7_ask_spouse
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.friends|talk.day pair.band=friends|acquaintances other.spouse
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {f7_asked=spouse f7_chain=share} And how's #other.spouse# keeping? | {f7_asked=spouse f7_chain=share} Give my best to #other.spouse#. Is all well there? | {f7_asked=spouse f7_chain=share} I saw #other.spouse# at the market. Looking well, I thought. | {f7_asked=spouse f7_chain=share} Is #other.spouse# still putting up with you?
then other: family.share_answer

rule f7_ask_child
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.friends|talk.day pair.band=friends|acquaintances other.child other.age<=36
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {f7_asked=child f7_chain=share} How's young #other.child#? | {f7_asked=child f7_chain=share} Is #other.child# behaving? | {f7_asked=child f7_chain=share} #other.child#'s getting so big. What are you feeding #other.child_them#? | {f7_asked=child f7_chain=share} I saw #other.child# chasing geese by the well. Fast, that one.
then other: family.share_answer

rule f7_ask_child_grown
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.friends|talk.day pair.band=friends|acquaintances other.child other.age>=46
does ask.detail
cooldown 3d
say {f7_asked=child_grown f7_chain=share} How's #other.child# getting on these days? | {f7_asked=child_grown f7_chain=share} Do you see much of #other.child#? | {f7_asked=child_grown f7_chain=share} I saw #other.child# the other day. The image of you. | {f7_asked=child_grown f7_chain=share} Is #other.child# settled yet?
then other: family.share_answer

rule f7_ask_mother
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.friends pair.band=friends other.mother other.stage=adult|old
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {f7_asked=mother f7_chain=share} How's your mother? Still going strong? | {f7_asked=mother f7_chain=share} Is #other.mother# well? I've not seen her at the well. | {f7_asked=mother f7_chain=share} Tell #other.mother# I'll bring the jar back. I've not forgotten. | {f7_asked=mother f7_chain=share} Your mother gave me such a look in the market. What have I done?
then other: family.share_answer

rule f7_ask_widowed
when concept=talk.friends|talk.day pair.band=friends other.widowed=yes
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {f7_asked=alone f7_chain=share} How are you managing, on your own? | {f7_asked=alone f7_chain=share} Are you eating? You look thin. | {f7_asked=alone f7_chain=share} Come to us for #supper#. You shouldn't be alone every night. | {f7_asked=alone f7_chain=share} I still miss them, you know. I can't think how you must.
then other: family.share_answer

rule f7_tell_inlaws
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.friends self.spouse pair.kin!=spouses
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {f7_share=inlaws f7_chain=share} #self.spouse#'s family are coming for the festival. All of them. | {f7_share=inlaws f7_chain=share} My mother-in-law has opinions about my cooking. Loud ones. | {f7_share=inlaws f7_chain=share} We've the in-laws staying. Can I sleep at yours? | {f7_share=inlaws f7_chain=share} #self.spouse#'s brother has borrowed my good saw. For a year now.
then other: family.share_answer

rule f7_tell_child_trouble
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.friends self.child self.age<=40
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {f7_share=child_news f7_chain=share} #self.child# wants to go off and see the world. I'm not ready. | {f7_share=child_news f7_chain=share} #self.child# has a sweetheart. Don't tell anyone I told you. | {f7_share=child_news f7_chain=share} #self.child# broke a window. With a cabbage. Don't ask me how. | {f7_share=child_news f7_chain=share} #self.child# brought home a fox cub. It's in the woodshed. It bites.
then other: family.share_answer

rule f7_tell_childless
when concept=talk.friends self.married=yes self.parent=no self.stage=adult self.age<=40
does tell.self
cooldown 4d
say {f7_share=childless f7_chain=share} Everyone asks when we'll have pups. Everyone. | {f7_share=childless f7_chain=share} We'd hoped there'd be little ones by now. | {f7_share=childless f7_chain=share} It'll happen or it won't. That's what I tell myself. | {f7_share=childless f7_chain=share} The midwife looked at me in the street today. Just looked.
then other: family.share_answer

rule f7_tell_family_house
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.friends self.house
does tell.self
cooldown 4d
say {f7_share=house_life f7_chain=share} The House has us all at the head's table this month. Dreadful food. | {f7_share=house_life f7_chain=share} Everyone in my family works for the House. Cousins, aunts, the cat. | {f7_share=house_life f7_chain=share} You never get away from the family when the family's the House. | {f7_share=house_life f7_chain=share} My uncle's been made a steward. We'll never hear the end of it.
then other: family.share_answer

# =============================================================================================== family.worry_answer (self answers the worry)
# Keyed by conv.f7_worry, priority 1, so the right kind of answer always speaks; the tone it remembers chooses the
# opener's last word.

rule f7_wa_plain
when concept=family.worry_answer
does reassure
say Hm. Let me think on it. | One thing at a time. | We'll see. We'll see.

rule f7_wa_money
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=money
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} We'll manage. We always have. | {f7_tone=kind} Something'll turn up. It always does. | {f7_tone=kind} I'll ask about for extra work. | {f7_tone=kind} Then we tighten our belts another notch.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_money_warm
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=money self.warmth=warm
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Come here. We'll sort it, you and me. | {f7_tone=kind} Don't carry it on your own. Give me half. | {f7_tone=kind} Whatever comes, it comes to both of us.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_money_poor
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=money self.wealth=poor|destitute
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I'll ask at the inn for a day's carrying. | {f7_tone=kind} We could sell the good pot. We never use it good. | {f7_tone=kind} I can go without the ale. I'll go without the ale. | {f7_tone=kind} I've a few pennies in my boot. I was saving them. Here.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_money_ambitious
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=money self.drive=ambitious
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I'll find more work. I'll find two lots of work. | {f7_tone=kind} This won't be us forever. I promise you that. | {f7_tone=kind} Next year we'll laugh at this. I'll make sure of it.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_money_short
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=money self.temper=short
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} If you didn't spend it on ribbons. | {f7_tone=sharp} Don't look at me. I bring it home. | {f7_tone=sharp} Then we eat less. Simple. | {f7_tone=sharp} What do you want, a miracle?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_money_sly
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=money self.honesty=sly
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sly} Leave the landlord to me. He owes me a favour. Sort of. | {f7_tone=sly} There's ways. Don't ask what ways. | {f7_tone=sly} I know a fellow. I always know a fellow.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_money_dry
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=money self.humour=dry
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Well, it can't get worse. Don't quote me. | {f7_tone=jest} Good. I was short of things to lie awake over. | {f7_tone=jest} Shall I panic now, or after #supper#?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_money_merry
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=money self.humour=merry
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Chin up. Nobody ever died of an empty jar. A few came close. | {f7_tone=jest} We'll laugh about this. Not yet. But we will. | {f7_tone=jest} Poor, but handsome. That's us.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_money_nervy
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=money self.temper=nervy
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fret} Oh, don't. Now I'll not sleep either. | {f7_tone=fret} I knew it. I knew something was wrong. | {f7_tone=fret} What do we do? What do we do?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_money_comfortable
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=money self.wealth=comfortable|rich
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} It's a lean month, not a lean life. | {f7_tone=kind} We've put by. It's what putting by is for. | {f7_tone=kind} Then we go without the cream a while. We'll live.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_money_devout
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=money self.piety=devout
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} The Bright One's never let us starve yet. | {f7_tone=kind} I'll light a candle for it. And then I'll go and find work. | {f7_tone=kind} We've a roof today. Give thanks for today.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_shop
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=shop
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Something'll turn. Trade always turns. | {f7_tone=kind} Then we tighten our belts till it does. | {f7_tone=kind} Folk are #skint# everywhere. It's not you. | {f7_tone=kind} Put a sign out. A big one. With a pie on it.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_shop_merchant
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=shop self.role=merchant
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Sell the stale stock cheap by noon, and start again. | {f7_tone=kind} Every shop has a bad season. Mine had three in a row. | {f7_tone=kind} Find what the market's short of, and sell that.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_shop_warm
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=shop self.warmth=warm
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Whatever happens to the shop, I'm still here. | {f7_tone=kind} Shop or no shop, you're the best thing on this street. | {f7_tone=kind} We started with nothing. We know how.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_shop_short
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=shop self.temper=short
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Then stop moaning and lower your prices. | {f7_tone=sharp} I said that corner was a bad spot. I said. | {f7_tone=sharp} Moping at the counter won't bring them in.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_shop_dry
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=shop self.humour=dry
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} On the bright side, the shelves have never been tidier. | {f7_tone=jest} Well, at least nobody's stealing from it. | {f7_tone=jest} You could sell tickets to look at the empty shop. Novelty.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_shop_nervy
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=shop self.temper=nervy
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fret} What'll we do? What'll we do if it goes? | {f7_tone=fret} I've been dreading this. All month I've been dreading it. | {f7_tone=fret} Don't say it. If you say it, it'll happen.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_watch
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=watch
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fret} Come home safe. That's all I ask. That's all. | {f7_tone=fret} Stand at the back. For me. | {f7_tone=fret} I hate that sword. I hate that it's yours. | {f7_tone=fret} Promise me you'll not be a hero.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_watch_dry
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=watch self.humour=dry
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Next time let the drunk win. It's quicker. | {f7_tone=jest} Tell your captain I'm worse than any knife, and I want you back whole. | {f7_tone=jest} Missed mostly. Wonderful. I'll sleep like a pup.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_watch_short
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=watch self.temper=short
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Then tell the captain no. You're allowed to say no. | {f7_tone=sharp} Every week it's something. Every week. | {f7_tone=sharp} They don't pay you enough to bleed for them.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_watch_devout
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=watch self.piety=devout
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fret} I pray every night you're on the walls. Every night. | {f7_tone=fret} The Bright One keeps the watch too. I've asked. | {f7_tone=fret} I'll light a candle at the gate shrine. Two.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_worn
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=worn
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Then something will give. Not you. | {f7_tone=kind} Sit. I'll do #supper#. | {f7_tone=kind} Tell them you're a wolf, not a mule. | {f7_tone=kind} Sleep. I'll wake you when the pot's hot.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_worn_short
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=worn self.temper=short
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Then stop saying yes to everything. | {f7_tone=sharp} You'll work yourself into the ground, and then where will I be? | {f7_tone=sharp} I've told you. I've told you a hundred times.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_worn_dry
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=worn self.humour=dry
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Standing up! You've learned a trick. They'll want you at the fair. | {f7_tone=jest} Worn to the pads. Shall I have you resoled? | {f7_tone=jest} Good. You'll sleep through my snoring for once.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_worn_tired
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=worn self.tired=yes
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} You and me both. Two old boots by the fire, the pair of us. | {f7_tone=kind} Sit down before you fall down. I'll sit with you. | {f7_tone=kind} I'd rub your feet if I could lift my arms.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_roofless
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=roofless
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} At least we're together. At least that. | {f7_tone=kind} The chapel porch is dry. We'll try there. | {f7_tone=kind} One day a door of our own. With a lock. And a step. | {f7_tone=kind} Lie close, then. We'll be warm enough.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_roofless_short
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=roofless self.temper=short
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Don't. I can't hear it tonight. | {f7_tone=sharp} I know where we are. I don't need telling. | {f7_tone=sharp} Save your breath for keeping warm.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_roofless_devout
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=roofless self.piety=devout
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} The Bright One sees us. Even here. | {f7_tone=kind} We'll pray, and then we'll find a barn. In that order. | {f7_tone=kind} The Bright One had no roof either, the old songs say.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_damp
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=damp
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I'll stuff the gap with rags. It'll hold till spring. | {f7_tone=kind} We've had worse. Remember the first room? | {f7_tone=kind} I'll speak to the landlord. Again. | {f7_tone=kind} Hang the bedding by the fire. It'll dry. Mostly.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_damp_short
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=damp self.temper=short
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} And what do you want me to do, drain the Sound? | {f7_tone=sharp} It's the Sump. It's damp. That's what the Sump is. | {f7_tone=sharp} Complain to the landlord, not to me.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_damp_dry
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=damp self.humour=dry
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Damp's free. It's the one thing round here they don't charge for. | {f7_tone=jest} We'll keep fish in the bedding. Save on the fishmonger. | {f7_tone=jest} The rats have to eat too, I suppose. Apparently from our sack.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_noise
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=noise
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} It's the cat from next door. It's always the cat. | {f7_tone=kind} I barred it. I barred it twice. Go to sleep. | {f7_tone=kind} It's the wind. Listen. There. Wind. | {f7_tone=kind} I'll look. Stay here. No, don't come. Fine, come.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_noise_short
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=noise self.temper=short
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} It's nothing. It's always nothing. Sleep. | {f7_tone=sharp} If it's a thief, I hope he's quieter than you. | {f7_tone=sharp} Every night. Every single night.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_noise_dry
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=noise self.humour=dry
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} If it's a thief, he's welcome to the turnips. | {f7_tone=jest} It's a ghost. A very small one. With a mouse's tail. | {f7_tone=jest} Whoever it is, they'll find nothing worth the climb.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_noise_nervy
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=noise self.temper=nervy
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fret} I heard it too. Don't move. | {f7_tone=fret} Get the poker. Quietly. | {f7_tone=fret} Shh. There. Again. You heard that?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_noise_guard
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=noise self.role=guard
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I'll look. I do it every night for strangers. I can do it for you. | {f7_tone=kind} Stay behind me. If it's anything, it's a cat. | {f7_tone=kind} I know every noise this street makes. That's the gutter.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_child
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=child
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I'll talk to them tonight. Gently. | {f7_tone=kind} They're growing. It takes them strange. | {f7_tone=kind} We were the same at that age. Worse. | {f7_tone=kind} Leave it a day. If it's still there, we'll ask.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_child_warm
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=child self.warmth=warm
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I'll take them fishing. They talk when their paws are busy. | {f7_tone=kind} I'll sit with them after #supper#. Just sit. | {f7_tone=kind} Leave a candle by the bed. They'll come to us when they're ready.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_child_short
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=child self.temper=short
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} They'll get a piece of my mind, is what they'll get. | {f7_tone=sharp} You coddle them. That's what this is. | {f7_tone=sharp} When I was that age I'd have had a clip round the ear.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_child_grown
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=child self.age>=48
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} They've their own lives now. It's as it should be. | {f7_tone=kind} I'll go round on Restday. With a pie. | {f7_tone=kind} They're grown. They'll come to us when they need to. | {f7_tone=kind} We did the same to our folks. Worse.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_child_fret
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=child_fret
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} They're tougher than you think. | {f7_tone=kind} You fret enough for the both of us. | {f7_tone=kind} I'll look in on them on my way to bed. | {f7_tone=kind} Pups are made of leather and noise. They'll do.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_child_fret_nervy
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=child_fret self.temper=nervy
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fret} Now you've said it I'll not sleep. I'll go and look. | {f7_tone=fret} Should we fetch the healer? Should we? | {f7_tone=fret} Oh, Bright One. I'll check the shutters again.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_child_fret_short
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=child_fret self.temper=short
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Leave them be. You'll smother them. | {f7_tone=sharp} They're fine. You're the one I'm worried about. | {f7_tone=sharp} Every night it's something new with you.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_hurt_you
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=hurt_you
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=brave} It's nothing. A knock. | {f7_tone=brave} Don't look at it like that. It looks worse than it is. | {f7_tone=brave} Ow. Yes. All right, it's something. | {f7_tone=brave} I'll live. Just about.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_hurt_you_bad
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=hurt_you self.injured=bad
does reassure
priority 2
say {f7_tone=fret} I can't feel my paw, #pet#. I'm frightened. | {f7_tone=fret} Stay with me a while. Don't go. | {f7_tone=fret} Fetch the healer. Please. I'm not being brave about this one.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_hurt_you_short
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=hurt_you self.temper=short
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Stop fussing. It's a scratch. | {f7_tone=sharp} Leave it. I said leave it. | {f7_tone=sharp} I'll bind it myself. I've paws, haven't I?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_hurt_me
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=hurt_me
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Lean on me. Slowly, now. | {f7_tone=kind} Fuss is all I'm good for. Sit. | {f7_tone=kind} There. Boot off. Now the other one. | {f7_tone=kind} No use at work, and no use arguing. Sit.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_hurt_me_healer
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=hurt_me self.job=healer
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Let me look properly. Hold still. Hm. Yes. You'll live. | {f7_tone=kind} Clean it, bind it, rest it. And no, you can't skip the rest. | {f7_tone=kind} I've seen this a hundred times. You'll mend.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_hurt_me_short
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=hurt_me self.temper=short
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} I told you to be careful. Did I not tell you? | {f7_tone=sharp} Sit down before you make it worse. | {f7_tone=sharp} What did you do? No. Sit first. Then tell me.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_hurt_me_dry
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=hurt_me self.humour=dry
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} You'll do anything to get out of the washing. | {f7_tone=jest} Fuss a bit. I'll fuss a lot, and charge you for it. | {f7_tone=jest} There. I'll carve you a crutch. A fancy one.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_hurt_me_nervy
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=hurt_me self.temper=nervy
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fret} Bright One. Bright One, look at you. Sit. Sit! | {f7_tone=fret} Is it bleeding? Is it still bleeding? | {f7_tone=fret} I'll fetch the healer. I'll run. Don't move.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_grief
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=grief
does reassure
priority 1
say I know. I know. | Come here. You don't have to talk. | We'll get through it. Not over it. Through it. | I'm here. I'm not going anywhere.

rule f7_wa_grief_devout
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=grief self.piety=devout
does reassure
priority 1
say They're with the Bright One now. Warm, and waiting. | I'll ask the priest to say their name on Restday. | We'll see them again. I believe that. I have to.

rule f7_wa_grief_mourning
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=grief self.mourning=kin
does reassure
priority 2
say I keep laying out their bowl. | I've no comfort to give. I've none for me. | Hold on to me, then. And I'll hold on to you.

rule f7_wa_grief_cold
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=grief self.warmth=cold
does reassure
priority 1
say It happens. It happens to everyone. | Crying won't bring them back. I'm sorry. It won't. | Sit down. I'll make something hot. That's what I can do.

rule f7_wa_grief_old
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=grief self.stage=old
does reassure
priority 1
say You don't stop missing them. You get used to carrying it. | I've buried more than I can count. It never gets lighter. You get stronger. | Tell me about them. The good bits. Go on.

rule f7_wa_kin
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=kin
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Then we'll go round on Restday. Both of us. | {f7_tone=kind} Bring them here. We'll find the room. | {f7_tone=kind} Old folk are tougher than they look. But aye. Let's go. | {f7_tone=kind} I'll look in on the way home tomorrow.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_kin_sib
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=kin pair.kin=siblings
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I'll go round tomorrow. You went last time. | {f7_tone=kind} We'll take turns. You mornings, me evenings. | {f7_tone=kind} Don't put it all on me. But aye. I'll talk to him. | {f7_tone=kind} I know. I've seen it too. I didn't want to say.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_kin_cold
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=kin self.warmth=cold pair.band=spouses
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Your family, your worry. | {f7_tone=sharp} They've others to look in on them. Let them do something for once. | {f7_tone=sharp} We can't take in everyone.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_kin_nervy
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=kin self.temper=nervy
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fret} Oh, don't. That's how it started with my #gran#. | {f7_tone=fret} Go now. Tonight. What if it's tonight? | {f7_tone=fret} I've had a bad feeling all week.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_kin_healer
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=kin self.job=healer
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I'll come and look at them. Properly. Tomorrow. | {f7_tone=kind} Bring them by. I'll know more when I've seen them. | {f7_tone=kind} It may be nothing. It may not. I'll look.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_kin_old
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=kin self.stage=old
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} It comes to us all. Be gentle with them. | {f7_tone=kind} Let them be stubborn. It's all they've got left. | {f7_tone=kind} Go and sit with them. That's the medicine.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_move
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=move
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=doubt} And go where? With what? | {f7_tone=doubt} Everyone we know is here. | {f7_tone=doubt} Maybe. One day. Not this year. | {f7_tone=doubt} You say that every spring.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_move_restless
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=move self.drive=restless
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=eager} Yes. Bright One, yes. When? | {f7_tone=eager} I've been waiting years for you to say that. | {f7_tone=eager} Pack tonight. Before either of us changes our mind.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_move_content
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=move self.drive=content
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=doubt} Everything I want's under this roof. Why would I go? | {f7_tone=doubt} You'd miss the bakery inside a week. | {f7_tone=doubt} Go if you must. I'll keep your side of the bed warm.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_move_old
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=move self.stage=old
does reassure
priority 1
say {f7_tone=doubt} At our age? We'd not survive the cart. | {f7_tone=doubt} I've moved once. It took me ten years to stop getting lost. | {f7_tone=doubt} They'll carry me out of here. Not before.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_wa_death
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=death
does reassure
priority 1
say Don't talk like that. Not tonight. | You'll go second. I've decided. I'm too stubborn. | Whoever it is, the other one has to eat properly. Promise. | Hush. Hold my paw and hush.

rule f7_wa_death_dry
when concept=family.worry_answer conv.f7_worry=death self.humour=dry
does reassure
priority 1
say Me first. I'm not doing the pots on my own. | You'd only go first to get the good spot. | They can sing what they like. I'll not be listening.

# =============================================================================================== family.tease_answer
# Keyed by conv.f7_tease: a grumble about a chore is answered as one, a flirt as a flirt.

rule f7_ta_plain
when concept=family.tease_answer
does tease.return
say Hm. | Is that so. | Well, there it is.

rule f7_ta_chore
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=chore
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=dodge} It wasn't me. | {f7_tone=dodge} I'll pretend I didn't hear that. | {f7_tone=dodge} You're not perfect either, you know. | {f7_tone=dodge} I'll see to it. Later.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_chore_merry
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=chore self.humour=merry
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} You love it really. | {f7_tone=jest} Guilty. Lock me up. | {f7_tone=jest} And yet here you are. Still. | {f7_tone=jest} I'll have you know I'm a delight.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_chore_dry
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=chore self.humour=dry
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Noted. Filed. Ignored. | {f7_tone=jest} Shocking. Someone should do something. | {f7_tone=jest} I'll add it to the list. It's a long list.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_chore_short
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=chore self.temper=short
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Don't start. | {f7_tone=sharp} Every time. Every single time. | {f7_tone=sharp} You do it then, if you're so clever.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_chore_warm
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=chore self.warmth=warm
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Sorry, #pet#. I'll do it now. | {f7_tone=kind} You're right. You're always right. It's very annoying. | {f7_tone=kind} Come here, you grump.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_chore_cold
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=chore self.warmth=cold
does tease.return
priority 1
say Mm. | If you say so. | Is that all?

rule f7_ta_chore_sly
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=chore self.honesty=sly
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Must've been the neighbours. | {f7_tone=jest} I'd never. Who says I did? | {f7_tone=jest} I'll tell you what I'll do. Nothing. But nicely.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_chore_quiet
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=chore self.talk=quiet
does tease.return
priority 1
say ... | Hm. | Aye.

rule f7_ta_chore_chatty
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=chore self.talk=chatty
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=dodge} Well, that's rich from you, after the business with the goose. | {f7_tone=dodge} Oh, I could tell you a thing or two about that. And I will. At length. | {f7_tone=dodge} That reminds me, did I tell you what the baker said?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_chore_old
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=chore self.stage=old
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Forty years I've heard that. Forty. | {f7_tone=jest} At my age I'll do as I please. | {f7_tone=jest} I've forgotten what you said already. Lucky me.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_chore_teen
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=chore self.stage=adolescent
does tease.return ask.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} You're so annoying. | {f7_tone=sharp} Fine. Fine! Happy? | {f7_tone=sharp} Why is it always me?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_spend
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=spend
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=dodge} We can afford it. That's rather the point of us. | {f7_tone=dodge} It's quality, #dear#. Quality lasts. | {f7_tone=dodge} Would you rather we looked like the neighbours? | {f7_tone=dodge} It was a bargain. For what it was.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_spend_warm
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=spend self.warmth=warm
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I bought it thinking of you. Mostly. | {f7_tone=kind} You'll like it when you see it. I promise. | {f7_tone=kind} It's for the both of us. Truly.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_spend_short
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=spend self.temper=short
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} It's my money as much as yours. | {f7_tone=sharp} I'll spend what I like. | {f7_tone=sharp} You've your horses. I've my things.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_duty
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=duty
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=grudge} Must I? | {f7_tone=grudge} I'll smile. I won't mean it. | {f7_tone=grudge} One hour. Then I'm ill. | {f7_tone=grudge} If I must. I'll be charming. Briefly.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_duty_merry
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=duty self.humour=merry
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} I'll be the life of it. You'll regret asking. | {f7_tone=jest} I'll dance with every one of them. Twice. | {f7_tone=jest} I'll be so pleasant they'll never ask us again.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_duty_short
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=duty self.temper=short
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=grudge} Fine. But I'm not talking to anyone. | {f7_tone=grudge} I'll go. I'll not enjoy it. | {f7_tone=grudge} Why is it always us?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_duty_quiet
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=duty self.talk=quiet
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=grudge} Must I speak? | {f7_tone=grudge} I'll stand by the wall. | {f7_tone=grudge} You talk. I'll nod.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_kin
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=kin
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=shrug} That's family for you. | {f7_tone=shrug} They mean well. Mostly. | {f7_tone=shrug} Ignore them. I do. | {f7_tone=shrug} I'll have a word. A gentle one. A very gentle one.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_kin_spouse
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=kin pair.band=spouses
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} That's my family you're talking about. You're not wrong, but still. | {f7_tone=jest} You married into it. There's no giving it back. | {f7_tone=jest} They were like that before you. They'll be like that after.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_kin_short
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=kin self.temper=short
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Then don't let them in. | {f7_tone=sharp} I'm not my family. Don't take it out on me. | {f7_tone=sharp} Every visit. Every single visit.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_kin_merry
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=kin self.humour=merry
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Next time hide the pots first. | {f7_tone=jest} They like you really. They just show it oddly. | {f7_tone=jest} Married the wolf, married the pack.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_envy
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=envy
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=hurt} Don't be like that. | {f7_tone=hurt} Say it. Whatever it is, say it. | {f7_tone=hurt} It's not like that and you know it. | {f7_tone=hurt} I've not changed. Have I?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_envy_warm
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=envy self.warmth=warm
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} If you need something, you've only to ask. You know that. | {f7_tone=kind} Come to mine for the festival. I'll not hear no. | {f7_tone=kind} You're my blood. Coat or no coat.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_envy_short
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=envy self.temper=short
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Here we go. | {f7_tone=sharp} Not this again. | {f7_tone=sharp} I worked for every penny. Every one.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_pups
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=pups
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} So? | {f7_tone=sharp} Don't care. | {f7_tone=sharp} You're the baby, not me. | {f7_tone=sharp} Shan't.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_pups_teen
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=pups self.stage=adolescent
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Grow up. | {f7_tone=sharp} Go away. | {f7_tone=sharp} I'm not even listening.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_pups_merry
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=pups self.stage=young self.humour=merry
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} *blows a raspberry* | {f7_tone=jest} You've got jam on your FACE. | {f7_tone=jest} I can't hear you. I'm a turnip.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_dare
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=dare
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=eager} Can too! Watch me! | {f7_tone=eager} Easy. Watch. | {f7_tone=eager} You go first, then. | {f7_tone=eager} Bet I can and you can't.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_dare_nervy
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=dare self.temper=nervy|calm
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=scared} #mum.capitalize# says we're not to. | {f7_tone=scared} I don't want to. | {f7_tone=scared} What if we get caught?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_dare_teen
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=dare self.stage=adolescent
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} That's a pup's game. | {f7_tone=sharp} I'm not five. | {f7_tone=sharp} Go on, then. Show me how it's done.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_ale
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=ale
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=dodge} One more. One. | {f7_tone=dodge} I'm merry, not drunk. | {f7_tone=dodge} Four. But who's counting? You are. | {f7_tone=dodge} The night's young.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_ale_merry
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=ale self.humour=merry
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Dance with me and I'll stop. | {f7_tone=jest} One more and I'll sing. You've been warned. | {f7_tone=jest} Come and have one yourself. You'll like me better.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_ale_short
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=ale self.temper=short
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} I'll drink what I like. | {f7_tone=sharp} I work all week. I'll have my ale. | {f7_tone=sharp} Don't you tell the keeper anything.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_snap
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=snap
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=soothe} I didn't say a word. | {f7_tone=soothe} Sit, then. I'll bring you something. | {f7_tone=soothe} All right. All right. | {f7_tone=soothe} Shall I go out again and come back in?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_snap_short
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=snap self.temper=short
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Don't take it out on me. | {f7_tone=sharp} Then sit and sulk. I'm not stopping you. | {f7_tone=sharp} I've had a day too, you know.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_snap_merry
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=snap self.humour=merry
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Not a word. I'll just stand here and look lovely. | {f7_tone=jest} I'll be very quiet. Like a mouse. A big, handsome mouse. | {f7_tone=jest} Shall I sing? No? I'll sing quietly.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_flirt
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=flirt
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fond} Go on with you. | {f7_tone=fond} Behave. People can hear. | {f7_tone=fond} You're a fool. My fool. | {f7_tone=fond} Ask me again when I've eaten.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_flirt_merry
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=flirt self.humour=merry
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fond} Only if you carry me. | {f7_tone=fond} Yes. Again. Every day. | {f7_tone=fond} You first.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_flirt_dry
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=flirt self.humour=dry
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fond} I'll think about it. I've thought. Maybe. | {f7_tone=fond} Charming. Truly. Pass the bread. | {f7_tone=fond} You've been at the cider.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_flirt_warm
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=flirt self.warmth=warm
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fond} Come here, then. | {f7_tone=fond} I'd marry you a hundred times. | {f7_tone=fond} You still make me laugh. After all this.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_flirt_cold
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=flirt self.warmth=cold
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cool} Don't be soft. | {f7_tone=cool} People are looking. | {f7_tone=cool} Mm. Later.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_flirt_tired
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=flirt self.tired=yes
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cool} Not now. I'm too #tired# for charm. | {f7_tone=cool} Lovely. Now let me sit. | {f7_tone=cool} Save it for tomorrow.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_flirt_old
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=flirt self.stage=old
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fond} At our age? Bright One. Go on, then. | {f7_tone=fond} Mind my back. Then yes. | {f7_tone=fond} You old fool. Yes.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_jibe
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=jibe
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Charming. | {f7_tone=jest} I'll remember that. | {f7_tone=jest} Says you. | {f7_tone=jest} Look who's talking.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_jibe_spouse
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=jibe pair.band=spouses
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} And yet you married me. | {f7_tone=jest} You knew what I was when you said yes. | {f7_tone=jest} That's not what you said at the wedding.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_jibe_merry
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=jibe self.humour=merry
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Ha! Guilty. | {f7_tone=jest} And you love me for it. | {f7_tone=jest} I'll take that as a kindness.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_jibe_dry
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=jibe self.humour=dry
does tease.return
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} I'll have that carved on my stone. | {f7_tone=jest} How kind. How very kind. | {f7_tone=jest} I've been called worse. By you, mostly.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ta_jibe_short
when concept=family.tease_answer conv.f7_tease=jibe self.temper=short
does tease.return
