# =============================================================================================== family.share_answer
# Keyed by conv.f7_share (news, a memory, a plan, a fond word), or by conv.f7_asked when a friend asked after
# the answerer's family. Most end there; a warm or merry answer may get a last word.

rule f7_sa_plain
when concept=family.share_answer
does react.self
say Is that so? | Well, there's a thing. | I'd not thought of it like that.

rule f7_sa_years
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=years
does react.self
priority 1
say I remember. I remember all of it. | Feels like last week, and forever. | And I'd do every day of it again. | We've had our share, you and me.

rule f7_sa_years_warm
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=years self.warmth=warm
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Give me your paw. | {f7_tone=kind} Every year better than the last. Nearly every year. | {f7_tone=kind} I'd not swap a single one. Not even the leaky ones.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_years_merry
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=years self.humour=merry
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} And you've not changed a bit. Worse luck. | {f7_tone=jest} I remember you had more fur on top. | {f7_tone=jest} Long enough that I've stopped trying to win arguments.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_years_dry
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=years self.humour=dry
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Too long. Not long enough. Both. | {f7_tone=jest} I remember. I've been trying to forget. | {f7_tone=jest} Mm. I was younger then. So were you. Remarkably.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_years_cold
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=years self.warmth=cold
does react.self
priority 1
say Mm. | Don't go soft on me now. | Aye. Well. We're still here.

rule f7_sa_tender
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=tender
does react.self
priority 1
say There. Like always. | I'm not going anywhere. | Room for two. There always was. | *leans close*

rule f7_sa_tender_cold
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=tender self.warmth=cold
does react.self
priority 1
say Mm. Just for a bit. | Don't fuss. But all right. | If you must.

rule f7_sa_newlywed
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=newlywed
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} We'll get the hang of it. | {f7_tone=kind} I like it. All of it. Even that. | {f7_tone=kind} Ha! Look at us. Proper householders. | {f7_tone=kind} We'll learn. Everyone has to learn.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_newlywed_merry
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=newlywed self.humour=merry
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Married wolves! Who'd have thought it? | {f7_tone=jest} Married, and still no idea where the salt is. | {f7_tone=jest} Our first. There'll be a thousand more. I can't wait.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_proud_child
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=proud_child
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} That's our pup. | {f7_tone=kind} Gets that from you. | {f7_tone=kind} Don't let it go to their head. Or yours. | {f7_tone=kind} I saw. I nearly cried.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_proud_child_merry
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=proud_child self.humour=merry
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Next they'll be running the town. | {f7_tone=jest} That's my side of the family coming out. | {f7_tone=jest} We'll have them keeping our accounts by spring.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_proud_child_short
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=proud_child self.temper=short
does react.self
priority 1
say #bc_about_time# | Took them long enough. | Good. Now they can do it every day.

rule f7_sa_good
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=good
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} About time the world noticed. | {f7_tone=kind} Don't spend it all at once. | {f7_tone=kind} I'm proud of you. You know that? | {f7_tone=kind} Put some by. For the lean years.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_good_ambitious
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=good self.drive=ambitious
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=eager} A second shop next. Then a third. | {f7_tone=eager} This is only the start. You'll see. | {f7_tone=eager} Now we raise the prices. Just a touch.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_good_nervy
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=good self.temper=nervy
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fret} Don't say it out loud. You'll spoil it. | {f7_tone=fret} It won't last. Put it by. Put all of it by. | {f7_tone=fret} Touch wood. Touch it now.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_plan
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=plan
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I believe it. You'd talk the stones into it. | {f7_tone=kind} Steady. One thing at a time. | {f7_tone=kind} If anyone can, you can. | {f7_tone=kind} And when you're rich, remember who stood by you.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_plan_content
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=plan self.drive=content
does react.self ask.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=doubt} What's wrong with what we've got? | {f7_tone=doubt} We're happy enough, aren't we? | {f7_tone=doubt} More's not always better, #dear#.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_plan_dry
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=plan self.humour=dry
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Shall I start practising my bow? | {f7_tone=jest} And I'll be the power behind the counter. | {f7_tone=jest} Lovely. I'll order the gold sign.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_content
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=content
does react.self
priority 1
say It's enough. It's more than enough. | You and a full pot. I'll take that. | Aye. We've done all right. | Mm. The roof, though.

rule f7_sa_content_restless
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=content self.drive=restless|ambitious
does react.self
priority 1
say Enough for you, maybe. | Some days. Not every day. | Don't you ever want more? Even a little?

rule f7_sa_dayoff
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=dayoff
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=eager} Nothing. Gloriously nothing. | {f7_tone=eager} Walk out by the water, like we used to. | {f7_tone=eager} Stay in bed till noon. Then decide. | {f7_tone=eager} Your stew, and a long sit in the sun.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_dayoff_merry
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=dayoff self.humour=merry
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} Dance. In the yard. In our nightshirts. | {f7_tone=jest} Eat everything in the house, then sleep on the floor. | {f7_tone=jest} Let's be terrible. All day. Let's be terrible.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_dayoff_tired
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=dayoff self.tired=yes
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=eager} Sleep. Sleep, and then more sleep. | {f7_tone=eager} Lie in the sun like a pair of old cats. | {f7_tone=eager} Nothing. I've earned a day of nothing.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_tired
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=tired
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Come here, then. Where does it ache? | {f7_tone=kind} Sleep, then. I'll see to the pots. | {f7_tone=kind} Sit. I'll bring the bowl to you. | {f7_tone=kind} Poor thing. Feet up.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_tired_tired
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=tired self.tired=yes
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} You're tired? Lie down and say that. | {f7_tone=jest} We'll both sleep where we sit, then. | {f7_tone=jest} Whoever gets up first does the pots. Not me.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_pups_wish
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=pups_wish
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I've thought about it. More than you'd think. | {f7_tone=kind} One day. When the jar's fuller. | {f7_tone=kind} You've gone broody. I can see it. | {f7_tone=kind} A little one of ours. Imagine.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_pups_wish_poor
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=pups_wish self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.self
priority 1
say We can barely feed the two of us. | Not on what we earn. Not yet. | I'd love it. I'd love it, and I'd lie awake over it.

rule f7_sa_fest
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=fest
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=eager} Just try and stop me. | {f7_tone=eager} Only if you keep me on my feet. | {f7_tone=eager} Every dance. Every one. | {f7_tone=eager} Till the lamps go, and then a bit.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_fest_quiet
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=fest self.talk=quiet
does react.self
priority 1
say One dance. One. | If it's a slow one. | I'll watch. You dance.

rule f7_sa_market
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=market
does react.self
priority 1
say Bread, salt, candles. And no ribbons, I know. | I'll find you. I'll follow the smell of pie. | Noon. Bread stall. If I remember. | I'll get what we need and not a ribbon more.

rule f7_sa_cosy
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=cosy
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Suits me. Put another log on. | {f7_tone=kind} Come here, then. | {f7_tone=kind} Listen to it. Like a lullaby. | {f7_tone=kind} Just us. I like just us.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_cosy_short
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=cosy self.temper=short
does react.self
priority 1
say Somebody has to fetch the wood. Somebody who isn't me. | Cosy till the roof goes. | Fine. But you're doing the water.

rule f7_sa_far_home
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=far_home
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Some days I miss it so much it aches. | {f7_tone=kind} We'll go back. One summer. We'll go. | {f7_tone=kind} Home's where you are, now. But aye. | {f7_tone=kind} I dream of it too.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_far_home_content
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=far_home self.drive=content
does react.self
priority 1
say This is home now. I've made my peace. | It's not the place I miss. It's being young there. | We'd go back and find it changed. Best leave it.

rule f7_sa_city_miss
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=city_miss
does react.self
priority 1
say {f7_tone=jest} You'd hate it now. All that noise. | {f7_tone=jest} You'd be back here inside a week. | {f7_tone=jest} Ridgemere's not going anywhere. Nor are you, it seems. | {f7_tone=jest} You only miss the pies.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_sa_small
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=small
does react.self
priority 1
say Is that so. | Well, there's a thing. | Ha! | You do pick up some things.

rule f7_sa_small_merry
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=small self.humour=merry
does react.self
priority 1
say Ha! Tell me more. Tell me everything. | Best thing I've heard all day. | Oh, I'm telling everyone that.

rule f7_sa_small_dry
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=small self.humour=dry
does react.self
priority 1
say Fascinating. Truly. | Hold on, let me sit down for this. | And they say nothing happens round here.

rule f7_sa_supper
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=supper
does react.self
priority 1
say Something hot. Anything hot. | Your stew. If you're asking. | Whatever's going. | Pie. Always pie.

rule f7_sa_supper_poor
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=supper self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.self
priority 1
say Whatever there is. Which is bread. | Bread, and we'll call it something else. | Soup. The thin one.

rule f7_sa_supper_rich
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=supper self.wealth=rich
does react.self
priority 1
say Ask Cook. Cook decides everything. | Something plain. I'm sick of sauces. | Whatever's not pheasant.

rule f7_sa_our_mother
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=our_mother
does react.self
priority 1
say Ha. She would. | That's our mother. | I'll go round. Don't tell her I said I would. | She's not changed. She'll never change.

rule f7_sa_offer
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=offer
does react.self
priority 1
say I'm managing. | I'd sooner starve. Thank you, though. | ...Maybe. A little. Just till spring. | You always were the lucky one.

rule f7_sa_offer_warm
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=offer self.warmth=warm
does react.self
priority 1
say You're good to me. You always were. | I'll pay you back. Every penny. | Come here. I hate that I need it. Thank you.

rule f7_sa_sib_memory
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=sib_memory
does react.self
priority 1
say We were terrors, weren't we. | I think about those days more than you'd guess. | Ha! I'd forgotten. No, I hadn't. | Simpler then. Hungrier, but simpler.

rule f7_sa_gathering
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=gathering
does react.self
priority 1
say Us. You did it last time and we're still hearing about the gravy. | Not us. The roof's leaking. | All of us at once? Bright One help the furniture. | Whoever has the bigger table. So not us.

rule f7_sa_kin_trouble
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=kin_trouble
does react.self
priority 1
say Families, eh. | Leave me out of it. I've enough of my own. | It'll blow over. It always does. | Ha. That lot.

rule f7_sa_inlaws
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=inlaws
does react.self
priority 1
say Count the spoons after. | Bright One help you. | You can sleep at ours. Bring a blanket. | In-laws. Like weather. You wait them out.

rule f7_sa_child_news
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=child_news
does react.self
priority 1
say Ha! They keep you guessing. | That's pups for you. | They grow up while you blink. | You were worse. I remember.

rule f7_sa_child_news_parent
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=child_news self.child
does react.self
priority 1
say Mine was the same. Worse. | Wait till you hear what mine did. No, another time. | They're all at it. Something in the water.

rule f7_sa_childless
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=childless
does react.self
priority 1
say It'll come. Or it won't, and you'll sleep more than the rest of us. | There's time yet. | Folk should mind their own business. | You'd be a good one. When it comes.

rule f7_sa_childless_warm
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=childless self.warmth=warm
does react.self
priority 1
say Oh, #pet#. Come here. | Whatever comes, you've a good home to give it. | My door's open. Any time you want to talk about it.

rule f7_sa_house_life
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_share=house_life
does react.self
priority 1
say Better than no family. | At least the House feeds you. | I'd swap. For a week. | There's worse masters than a House.

rule f7_sa_spouse
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_asked=spouse self.spouse
does react.self
priority 1
say #self.spouse#? Well. Snoring fit to lift the thatch, but well. | #self.spouse#'s grand. Working too hard. As ever. | Oh, #self.spouse# is a treasure. Don't tell #self.spouse_them# I said so. | #self.spouse#'s well. I'll pass it on.

rule f7_sa_spouse_merry
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_asked=spouse self.spouse self.humour=merry
does react.self
priority 1
say #self.spouse#? Still putting up with me. The saint. | Still there when I get home. I keep checking. | #self.spouse#'s well. Says I'm the cross #self.spouse_they# bears.

rule f7_sa_spouse_short
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_asked=spouse self.spouse self.temper=short
does react.self
priority 1
say Ask #self.spouse# yourself. | Fine. We had words. We're fine. | Same as ever. Infuriating.

rule f7_sa_spouse_guarded
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_asked=spouse self.honesty=guarded
does react.self
priority 1
say Well enough. Why do you ask? | Oh, you know. We get on. | That's our business, I think.

rule f7_sa_child
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_asked=child self.child
does react.self
priority 1
say #self.child#? Into everything. Pots, puddles, other folk's gardens. | Growing out of every boot I buy. | #self.child# asked me where the sun sleeps. I'd no answer. | Loud. Happy. Muddy. In that order.

rule f7_sa_child_poor
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_asked=child self.child self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.self
priority 1
say Hungry, mostly. Growing, so hungry. | #self.child#'s a good pup. Better than we can give #self.child_them#. | I made #self.child# a ball from rags. Best toy in the street, they say.

rule f7_sa_child_warm
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_asked=child self.child self.warmth=warm
does react.self
priority 1
say #self.child# is the best thing I ever did. | Clever as anything. Doesn't get it from me. | #self.child# made me a necklace from acorns. I'm wearing it. Look.

rule f7_sa_child_alone
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_asked=child self.child self.married=no
does react.self
priority 1
say Just the two of us, and we manage. | #self.child# is all I've got, and all I need. | Hard, on your own. Worth it.

rule f7_sa_child_grown
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_asked=child_grown self.child
does react.self
priority 1
say Settled, near enough. Courting, if you please. | I see #self.child# Restdays. Not enough. | Doing better than I did at that age. | Too busy for their old parent. As it should be.

rule f7_sa_mother
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_asked=mother self.mother
does react.self
priority 1
say #self.mother#? Bossing the whole street, last I saw. | Still sharp as a needle. Sharper. | Slowing down. She won't admit it. | She asks after you, you know. She likes you. Don't ask me why.

rule f7_sa_alone
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_asked=alone
does react.self
priority 1
say I talk to the cat. The cat's no great talker. | It's the evenings. The days are all right. | You're kind to ask. Most folk don't, now. | I manage. Some days better than others.

rule f7_sa_alone_short
when concept=family.share_answer conv.f7_asked=alone self.temper=short
does react.self
priority 1
say I can boil an egg, you know. | I'm not made of glass. | I manage. Don't fuss.

# =============================================================================================== family.answer_parent (a son or daughter answers)

rule f7_ap_plain
when concept=family.answer_parent
does answer.detail
say Mm. | All right. | I heard you.

rule f7_ap_order
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=order self.stage=young
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} Do I have to? | {f7_tone=cheek} In a minute! | {f7_tone=cheek} But whyyy? | {f7_tone=cheek} All right. All right!
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_order_sly
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=order self.stage=young self.honesty=sly|guarded
does answer.detail ask.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} I already did. Before. When you weren't looking. | {f7_tone=cheek} Can I do it after? Long after? | {f7_tone=cheek} If I do it, can I have a honey cake?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_order_merry
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=order self.stage=young self.humour=merry
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=play} Yes, captain! | {f7_tone=play} Only if you say please. In a funny voice. | {f7_tone=play} I'll do it hopping. Watch!
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_order_quiet
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=order self.stage=young self.talk=quiet
does answer.detail
priority 1
say ...All right. | Yes. | *nods*

rule f7_ap_order_teen
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=order self.stage=adolescent
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} Fine. | {f7_tone=cheek} Why is it always me? | {f7_tone=cheek} I was going to. I was just about to. | {f7_tone=cheek} Can it wait till later?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_order_teen_short
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=order self.stage=adolescent self.temper=short
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} You never ask the others. | {f7_tone=cheek} Fine! I'll do everything, then! | {f7_tone=cheek} Stop telling me what to do.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_warn
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=warn
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=promise} I know. You always say. | {f7_tone=promise} I won't. I promise. | {f7_tone=promise} Why? What's there? | {f7_tone=promise} I won't. Not even if Pip does.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_warn_sly
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=warn self.honesty=sly
does answer.detail ask.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} I won't. Much. | {f7_tone=cheek} Not even a little bit near? | {f7_tone=cheek} What if I only look?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_ask
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=ask
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=chat} Nothing! | {f7_tone=chat} Lots. I don't remember. | {f7_tone=chat} We found a dead crow. It was brilliant. | {f7_tone=chat} I can't say. It's a secret.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_ask_chatty
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=ask self.talk=chatty
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=chat} Well, first we went to the well, and then Pip fell in, not all the way, and then... | {f7_tone=chat} Everything! I learned everything! Ask me anything! | {f7_tone=chat} We played wolves and wardens and I was the warden and I won.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_ask_quiet
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=ask self.talk=quiet
does answer.detail
priority 1
say ...Nothing. | Just things. | Can I sit on your lap instead?

rule f7_ap_mess
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=mess
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fib} It wasn't me. | {f7_tone=fib} It was like that when I got here. | {f7_tone=fib} I don't know. It just happened. | {f7_tone=fib} Somebody else did it. A big somebody.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_mess_merry
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=mess self.humour=merry
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=play} It's art. I made art. | {f7_tone=play} It was an accident. A brilliant accident. | {f7_tone=play} I was doing an experiment.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_mess_frank
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=mess self.honesty=frank
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sorry} It was me. Sorry. | {f7_tone=sorry} I did it. I'll clean it. | {f7_tone=sorry} Me. But I had a good reason. I've forgotten it.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_without
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=without
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sweet} Promise? | {f7_tone=sweet} Aww. | {f7_tone=sweet} All right. I don't even like sweets. | {f7_tone=sweet} Can I have some at the festival, then?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_without_short
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=without self.temper=short
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} It's not fair. Tam gets things every week. | {f7_tone=cheek} We never have anything. | {f7_tone=cheek} I hate this week.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_food
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=food
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sweet} Are you sure? You're not hungry? Truly? | {f7_tone=sweet} Can we share it? Half each? | {f7_tone=sweet} Thank you! Thank you! | {f7_tone=sweet} I'll save you the crust. The best bit.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_manners
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=manners
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} Must I? | {f7_tone=cheek} I'll be good. I'll be bored, but good. | {f7_tone=cheek} The stable pups are more fun than anyone in this house. | {f7_tone=cheek} Yes. Sorry. Yes.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_chapel
