say {f7_tone=sad} Are you sad too? | {f7_tone=sad} I drew them a picture. Can we give it to them? | {f7_tone=sad} Will you go away too? | {f7_tone=sad} Can I sit on your lap?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_bed
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=bed
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} One more story. One. A short one. | {f7_tone=cheek} My eyes are shut. These are different eyes. | {f7_tone=cheek} I'm not even tired. | {f7_tone=cheek} Can I have a drink of water? A big one?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_story
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=story
does answer.detail ask.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=eager} Yes! Tell it! | {f7_tone=eager} Is it a scary one? | {f7_tone=eager} Is it true? Truly true? | {f7_tone=eager} Can I sit on your lap for it?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_trade
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=trade
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=doubt} I don't know what I want. | {f7_tone=doubt} Maybe. I'll go and look. Just look. | {f7_tone=doubt} Can I think about it? | {f7_tone=doubt} I'd like to work with animals. Or boats. Or something.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_trade_ambitious
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=trade self.drive=ambitious|restless
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=doubt} I want my own shop. Not to sweep someone else's. | {f7_tone=doubt} There's work in the city that pays three times. | {f7_tone=doubt} I'll find my own. Better than that.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_master
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=master
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=chat} Hard, but fair. Mostly fair. | {f7_tone=chat} I ruined a whole day's work. Nobody shouted. That was worse. | {f7_tone=chat} I'm learning. My paws are learning faster than my head.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_master_short
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=master self.temper=short
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=chat} I'm sick of sweeping. I didn't come to sweep. | {f7_tone=chat} They shout. All day. At everything. | {f7_tone=chat} Too hard. And they never say well done.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_late
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=late
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} Out. | {f7_tone=cheek} Nowhere. Walking. | {f7_tone=cheek} At Fennick's. I said. | {f7_tone=cheek} Just a friend. Nobody.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_late_sly
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=late self.honesty=sly
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} Me? I was home by dark. You must have dozed off. | {f7_tone=cheek} Studying. At Fennick's. Very hard. | {f7_tone=cheek} The lamps were lit early tonight. Ask anyone.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_late_warm
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=late self.warmth=warm
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sweet} I was with someone. Someone nice. Don't laugh. | {f7_tone=sweet} I'm sorry. I lost track. I'm sorry you waited. | {f7_tone=sweet} We were talking. Just talking. For hours.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_scold
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=scold
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} What look? | {f7_tone=cheek} Fine. | {f7_tone=cheek} It's not a midden. It's organised. | {f7_tone=cheek} I didn't sigh. I breathed.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_leave
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=leave
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=doubt} I'll come back. I'll always come back. | {f7_tone=doubt} A year's forever. | {f7_tone=doubt} You were young once. You must have wanted to. | {f7_tone=doubt} I'm not going yet. Just... one day.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_match
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=match
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=doubt} I'll marry who I like. | {f7_tone=doubt} Must we talk about this? | {f7_tone=doubt} There's someone. Maybe. Don't ask me any more. | {f7_tone=doubt} When I'm ready. Not before.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_match_heights
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=match self.quarter=heights
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=doubt} I've met the Ashcombe pup. It has the conversation of a turnip. | {f7_tone=doubt} Is that what you two were? An alliance? | {f7_tone=doubt} I know my duty. I don't have to like it.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_earn
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=earn
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sweet} I know. I'll ask about tomorrow. | {f7_tone=sweet} I don't mind. Truly. I want to. | {f7_tone=sweet} I'm big enough. I'll carry anything. | {f7_tone=sweet} I've already asked. They'll take me.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_ask_teen
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=ask_teen
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} #bc_nothing# | {f7_tone=cheek} Nobody. Just someone. | {f7_tone=cheek} Nothing. Why does it matter? | {f7_tone=cheek} Can we not do this now?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_ask_teen_warm
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=ask_teen self.warmth=warm
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sweet} There's someone. Don't laugh. | {f7_tone=sweet} I'm worried I'll never be good at anything. | {f7_tone=sweet} Can I tell you later? When it's just us?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_grandpups
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=grandpups
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} When we're ready. Not before. | {f7_tone=cheek} Not this again. | {f7_tone=cheek} You'll be the first to know. After us. | {f7_tone=cheek} Must you? In the street?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_grandpup
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=grandpup self.child
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sweet} Restday, then. Hide the breakables. | {f7_tone=sweet} #self.child# talks about you all week. | {f7_tone=sweet} #self.child# eats like a horse. Takes after you. | {f7_tone=sweet} We'll come. Don't spoil them rotten.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_lonely
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=lonely
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sweet} Come and stay with us a while. | {f7_tone=sweet} I miss them too. | {f7_tone=sweet} Set out two. I'll come and drink the other. | {f7_tone=sweet} Come for #supper#. Tonight. I'll not hear no.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_hurt
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=hurt
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sweet} Let me see. Sit down. | {f7_tone=sweet} Rubbish yourself. You'll rest. | {f7_tone=sweet} I'll fetch the healer, and you'll let them look. | {f7_tone=sweet} No more of that step. I'll fix the rail.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_help
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=help
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sweet} I'll not take your money. I can manage. | {f7_tone=sweet} You've done enough. Keep it for yourself. | {f7_tone=sweet} ...Thank you. I'll pay it back. I will.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_help_warm
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=help self.warmth=warm
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sweet} I don't know what to say. Thank you. | {f7_tone=sweet} I'll make it up to you. All of it. | {f7_tone=sweet} You always did look after us.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_fret
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=fret
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} I'm fine. Truly. | {f7_tone=cheek} You worry too much. | {f7_tone=cheek} I'll come Restday. I promise. | {f7_tone=cheek} I eat. I eat plenty. Look at me.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_fret_warm
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=fret self.warmth=warm
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sweet} Come here. Let me hold you a minute. | {f7_tone=sweet} I'll stay for #supper#. Shall I? | {f7_tone=sweet} I know. I'll look after myself. For you.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_fret_short
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=fret self.temper=short
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=cheek} Not this again. | {f7_tone=cheek} Must we, every time? | {f7_tone=cheek} I'm a grown wolf. I'll live as I please.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ap_fret_parent
when concept=family.answer_parent conv.f7_pc=fret self.parent=yes
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sweet} Now I've my own, I understand you. Every word. | {f7_tone=sweet} I say the things you said. In your voice. It's horrible. | {f7_tone=sweet} You raised me. Let me look after you a bit.
then other: family.settle

# =============================================================================================== family.answer_child (a mother or father answers)

rule f7_ac_plain
when concept=family.answer_child
does answer.detail
say #bc_we_will_see# | Hm. | Is that so?

rule f7_ac_why
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=why
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} Now there's a question. | {f7_tone=fob} Ask me again after #supper#. | {f7_tone=fob} When you're bigger, you'll know. | {f7_tone=fob} Because. That's why.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_why_merry
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=why self.humour=merry
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=play} The moon told me, and the moon doesn't lie. | {f7_tone=play} Ask the hens. Hens know everything. | {f7_tone=play} It's a secret. The Bright One made me promise.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_why_dry
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=why self.humour=dry
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} When you find out, tell me. | {f7_tone=fob} Because the world is strange, pup, and so are you. | {f7_tone=fob} I've wondered that for forty years. Let me know.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_why_short
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=why self.temper=short
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} Because I said so. | {f7_tone=sharp} Not now. Not now! | {f7_tone=sharp} Enough questions. Wash.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_why_learned
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=why self.job=scholar|priest|healer
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=eager} Well. Sit down. It's rather a long answer. | {f7_tone=eager} Now that's a proper question. Let me draw it for you. | {f7_tone=eager} Nobody knows. But here's what some think.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_little
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=little
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=tale} Once. A very long time ago. | {f7_tone=tale} Little and naughty. Worse than you. | {f7_tone=tale} Oh, the trouble I got in. Don't tell your grandmother I told you. | {f7_tone=tale} I was smaller than you, and twice as loud.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_little_short
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=little self.temper=short
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} I was never any trouble. Never. | {f7_tone=fob} I did as I was told, that's what I did. | {f7_tone=fob} Ask me no questions. Go and play.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_poor
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=poor
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} We've each other, and that's more than coin. | {f7_tone=fob} We're not poor. We're careful. There's a difference. | {f7_tone=fob} Brindle's father owes us a penny. Tell him that. | {f7_tone=fob} We've a roof and a pot. Plenty haven't.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_poor_warm
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=poor self.warmth=warm
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} We're rich in the ways that count. Come here. | {f7_tone=kind} Poor's just a word. You've got a warm bed and me. | {f7_tone=kind} One day you'll have boots that shine. I promise you.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_hungry
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=hungry
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Here. Take mine. | {f7_tone=kind} I'll find something. Wait here. | {f7_tone=kind} There's an apple in my coat. Don't tell the others. | {f7_tone=kind} Soon, pup. The pot's on.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_hungry_poor
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=hungry self.wealth=poor|destitute
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Soon, pup. Drink some water. It fills you. | {f7_tone=kind} I'll go to the chapel. They'll have bread. | {f7_tone=kind} Here. The last of it. I've eaten.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_fear
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=fear
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} There's nothing out there but the wind. | {f7_tone=kind} All right. Just tonight. Bring your blanket. | {f7_tone=kind} The Fen Hag's scared of me. Everyone knows that. | {f7_tone=kind} Nothing's under your bed but socks.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_fear_nervy
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=fear self.temper=nervy
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fret} I heard it too. Stay here. Stay close. | {f7_tone=fret} Shh. Let's listen together. | {f7_tone=fret} It's nothing. It's surely nothing. Come in with me.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_grief
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=grief
does answer.detail
priority 2
say Come here. Come here, pup. | They loved you. That doesn't stop. | It's nobody's fault, pup. Nobody's. | They're resting now. Not hurting any more.

rule f7_ac_grief_devout
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=grief self.piety=devout
does answer.detail
priority 2
say They're with the Bright One now, in the warm. Waiting for us. | The Bright One has them now. They're safe. | We'll see them again. A long, long time from now.

rule f7_ac_rich
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=rich
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} Because we have a name to think of. | {f7_tone=fob} The river's no place for you. Nor for me, come to that. | {f7_tone=fob} You'll understand when you're older. Probably. | {f7_tone=fob} Rich means you have to go to dancing. I'm sorry.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_news
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=news
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Is that so! | {f7_tone=kind} Well, look at you. | {f7_tone=kind} Clever pup. | {f7_tone=kind} Show me later.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_news_warm
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=news self.warmth=warm
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Oh, you clever thing. Come here. | {f7_tone=kind} That's my pup! | {f7_tone=kind} Show me! Show me now!
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_news_tired
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=news self.tired=yes
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} Mm. Lovely, pup. | {f7_tone=fob} Tell me in the morning. All of it. | {f7_tone=fob} That's nice. Let me sit a minute.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_want
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=want
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} #bc_we_will_see# | {f7_tone=fob} Not today. | {f7_tone=fob} Ask me when your chores are done. | {f7_tone=fob} What did I say last time?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_want_warm
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=want self.warmth=warm
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Go on, then. Just this once. | {f7_tone=kind} If you're good all week. All week, mind. | {f7_tone=kind} Yes. Don't tell anyone I said so.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_want_poor
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=want self.wealth=poor|destitute
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} Not this week, pup. Next week. I hope. | {f7_tone=fob} We'll see what market day brings. | {f7_tone=fob} If I had it, it'd be yours.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_want_short
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=want self.temper=short
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} No. | {f7_tone=sharp} What did I say? I said no. | {f7_tone=sharp} Ask once more and it's no forever.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_leave
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=leave
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} Not yet. Not quite yet. | {f7_tone=fob} I know. I've always known. | {f7_tone=fob} And who'll eat my cooking? | {f7_tone=fob} The road'll still be there next year.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_leave_restless
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=leave self.drive=restless
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I wanted to go too, at your age. I wish I had. | {f7_tone=kind} Go. See the world. Write to me. | {f7_tone=kind} Don't end up like me, nailed to one street.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_leave_content
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=leave self.drive=content
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} The world's not so grand as you think. Home's here. | {f7_tone=fob} There's nothing out there we haven't got. | {f7_tone=fob} You'll come back. They all come back.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_leave_short
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=leave self.temper=short
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} You'll go when I say you'll go. | {f7_tone=sharp} Not while you're under my roof. | {f7_tone=sharp} And live on what? Air?
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_cramped
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=cramped
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} I know. I know, pup. | {f7_tone=kind} When there's coin, you'll have a curtain. I promise. | {f7_tone=kind} We're warm, at least. Four's warm. | {f7_tone=kind} Up the hill, is it? I'll hold you to that.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_work
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=work
does answer.detail
priority 1
say Learn all you can. Then learn some more. | Do as you're told, and watch what's done. | That's how it starts. Crooked, then straight. | Your master swept floors for years too. Ask them.

rule f7_ac_work_old
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=work self.stage=old
does answer.detail
priority 1
say My master had me sweep for a year before I touched a tool. | Every master's hard. The good ones are hard. | Mind your master and mind your paws. Both matter.

rule f7_ac_want_teen
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=want_teen
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} #bc_we_will_see# | {f7_tone=fob} If you're back before the lamps. | {f7_tone=fob} What's it worth to me? | {f7_tone=fob} Ask me again when your chores are done.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_want_teen_warm
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=want_teen self.warmth=warm
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Go on, then. Be careful. | {f7_tone=kind} Yes. Back by dark, mind. | {f7_tone=kind} All right. You're old enough. Nearly.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_want_teen_short
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=want_teen self.temper=short
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} No. And don't ask again. | {f7_tone=sharp} Not while you speak to me like that. | {f7_tone=sharp} Absolutely not.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_sulk
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=sulk
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} I was young once. I know that look. | {f7_tone=fob} We'll talk about it when you've calmed down. | {f7_tone=fob} Where you go, I worry. That's all it is. | {f7_tone=fob} You'll understand when you've pups of your own.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_sulk_merry
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=sulk self.humour=merry
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=play} Embarrassing? I've not even started. Watch me dance. | {f7_tone=play} I'll stop when you're forty. | {f7_tone=play} Pup, pup, pup. There. Out loud.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_care
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=care
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} I'm not dead yet. | {f7_tone=fob} Don't you fuss over me. I'm fine. | {f7_tone=fob} You're a good #child#. You always were. | {f7_tone=fob} I'll manage. I've managed sixty years.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_care_short
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=care self.temper=short
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=sharp} I'll ask when I need help. I've not asked. | {f7_tone=sharp} I'm old, not foolish. | {f7_tone=sharp} I raised you. I'll not be raised by you.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_care_hurt
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=care self.injured=light|bad
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} It's nothing. A bruise. Stop looking at it. | {f7_tone=fob} Fetch me the stick, then. Not a word. | {f7_tone=fob} Fine. You can carry it. Just this once.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_care_widowed
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=care_widowed
does answer.detail
priority 1
say I'll come for #supper#. Just tonight. Maybe tomorrow. | I talk to them, you know. In the evenings. | They'd be so proud of you. So proud. | Some days are better. Today's middling.

rule f7_ac_help
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=help
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} I'll not take charity from my own pup. | {f7_tone=fob} Keep it for yours. I've managed this long. | {f7_tone=fob} ...You're a good one. You always were.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_grandpup
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=grandpup
does answer.detail
priority 1
say Bring them round. I'll spoil them rotten. | That's my grandpup. That's my blood. | You did the very same at that age. The very same. | Bring them Restday. I've saved the honey.

rule f7_ac_shop
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=shop
does answer.detail
priority 1
say Trade's a river. Up, down. You keep rowing. | Sit down. Show me the books. | Every shop has a bad season. Ours had three. | I told you so. I'm not saying it. But I told you.

rule f7_ac_gran
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=gran
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=kind} Go on, then. Just the once. | {f7_tone=kind} If you sit still. | {f7_tone=kind} What's the magic word? | {f7_tone=kind} Come here, then, little one.
then other: family.settle

rule f7_ac_gran_short
when concept=family.answer_child conv.f7_cp=gran self.temper=short
does answer.detail
priority 1
say {f7_tone=fob} Not now, pup. My bones. | {f7_tone=fob} Later. If you're quiet. | {f7_tone=fob} Ask your mother.
then other: family.settle

# =============================================================================================== family.settle (the opener's last word)
# On the tone of the answer (conv.f7_tone) within its chain (conv.f7_chain), priority 1; a son's or daughter's
# answer to some things has a last word of its own (priority 3, by conv.f7_pc or f7_cp).

rule f7_st_plain
when concept=family.settle
does ack
say Hm. | Well. There it is. | #saying#.

rule f7_st_worry_kind
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=worry conv.f7_tone=kind
does ack
priority 1
say Thank you. I needed that. | What would I do without you? | Aye. All right. | You always know what to say.

rule f7_st_worry_sharp
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=worry conv.f7_tone=sharp
does ack
priority 1
say I only said. | Don't bite my head off. | Fine. I'll worry on my own, then. | There's no call for that.

rule f7_st_worry_jest
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=worry conv.f7_tone=jest
does ack
priority 1
say You're no help at all. Thank you. | Don't make me laugh. I'm trying to be miserable. | Ha. You're impossible.

rule f7_st_worry_fret
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=worry conv.f7_tone=fret
does ack
priority 1
say Now I've worried you. I'm sorry. | Don't you start as well. | Hush. We'll be all right. Won't we?

rule f7_st_worry_sly
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=worry conv.f7_tone=sly
does ack
priority 1
say I don't want to know, do I? | Nothing that gets you locked up. Promise me. | Your fellow had better be honest this time.

rule f7_st_worry_brave
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=worry conv.f7_tone=brave
does ack
priority 1
say Hold still and let me, then. | Brave, are we? Hold still. | Nothing, it says. Sit down.

rule f7_st_worry_doubt
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=worry conv.f7_tone=doubt
does ack
priority 1
say One day you'll say yes. | I mean it this time. | We'll see who's right.

rule f7_st_worry_eager
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=worry conv.f7_tone=eager
does ack
priority 1
say Steady! I only said what if. | Bright One. I thought you'd say no. | Soon. Not tonight. But soon.

rule f7_st_tease_dodge
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=dodge
does ack
priority 1
say I mean it, mind. | Don't think I'll forget. | We'll talk about this later. | Hmph.

rule f7_st_tease_jest
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=jest
does ack
priority 1
say Ha! You'll be the end of me. | Don't make me laugh. I'm cross with you. | Impossible. You're impossible.

rule f7_st_tease_jest_young
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=jest self.stage=young|adolescent
does ack
priority 1
say You're so weird. | *blows a raspberry back* | I'm still telling.

rule f7_st_tease_sharp
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=sharp
does ack
priority 1
say Don't you take that tone. | Touchy. | Bright One give me strength.

rule f7_st_tease_sharp_young
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=sharp self.stage=young
does ack
priority 1
say I'm telling! | Baby. | Am not! You are!

rule f7_st_tease_sharp_teen
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=sharp self.stage=adolescent
does ack
priority 1
say Ugh. | You're impossible. | Whatever.

rule f7_st_tease_kind
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=kind
does ack
priority 1
say Well. That's all right, then. | That's better. | Go on with you.

rule f7_st_tease_grudge
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=grudge
does ack
priority 1
say You must. And you'll smile. | Thank you. Best coat, mind. | That's all I ask.

rule f7_st_tease_shrug
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=shrug
does ack
priority 1
say Hmph. Families. | Your lot. You deal with them. | I'll hold my tongue. This time.

rule f7_st_tease_hurt
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=hurt
does ack
priority 1
say I'm only saying. | Forget it. | You know what I mean.

rule f7_st_tease_eager
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=eager
does ack
priority 1
say Go on, then! I'm watching! | Bet you won't. | Last one's a toad!

rule f7_st_tease_scared
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=scared
does ack
priority 1
say Scaredy. | Baby. I'll do it, then. | Fine. I'll go on my own.

rule f7_st_tease_soothe
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=soothe
does ack
priority 1
say Sorry. It's not you. | Thank you. Sorry. Thank you. | Bring the big bowl.

rule f7_st_tease_fond
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=fond
does ack
priority 1
say That's why I keep you. | You'll do. | Later, then. I'll hold you to it. | There's my wolf.

rule f7_st_tease_cool
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=tease conv.f7_tone=cool
does ack
priority 1
say Spoilsport. | Later. I'll hold you to it. | Fine. Be like that.

rule f7_st_share_kind
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=share conv.f7_tone=kind
does ack
priority 1
say Come here, you. | What would I do without you? | I know. I know. | You're good to me.

rule f7_st_share_jest
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=share conv.f7_tone=jest
does ack
priority 1
say Ha! You never change. | Cheek. | And that's why I put up with you.

rule f7_st_share_eager
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=share conv.f7_tone=eager
does ack
priority 1
say Done. | Agreed. Don't let anyone knock. | Then that's settled.

rule f7_st_share_fret
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=share conv.f7_tone=fret
does ack
priority 1
say Don't spoil it. Just enjoy it. | Touch wood, then. There. | Can't we be glad for one evening?

rule f7_st_share_doubt
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=share conv.f7_tone=doubt
does ack
priority 1
say You'll see. One day you'll see. | Dream a little, #dear#. It's free. | Happy, yes. Content? Never.

# A parent's last word, after their son or daughter answers.

rule f7_st_pc_cheek
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=cheek other.stage=young
does ack
priority 1
say Don't you cheek me. | I heard that. | Less of your lip. | Now, please.

rule f7_st_pc_cheek_teen
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=cheek other.stage=adolescent
does ack
priority 1
say Don't you roll your eyes at me. | Less of the lip. | I'll pretend I didn't hear that.

rule f7_st_pc_cheek_adult
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=cheek other.stage=adult|old
does ack
priority 1
say I'm only saying. | You'll understand one day. | Hmph. You were always stubborn.

rule f7_st_pc_play
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=play
does ack
priority 1
say Ha! Go on, you. | Come here, you. | That's my pup.

rule f7_st_pc_promise
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=promise
does ack
priority 1
say Good pup. | Mind you don't. | Never you mind why. Just don't.

rule f7_st_pc_chat
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=chat
does ack
priority 1
say Hm. Wash your paws, then. | Well, I'm glad you had a day. | You'll tell me at #supper#. All of it.

rule f7_st_pc_fib
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=fib
does ack
priority 1
say Your whiskers say otherwise. | Funny how it's always somebody. | And the paw prints? Whose are those?

rule f7_st_pc_sorry
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=sorry
does ack
priority 1
say Well. Thank you for saying. | Good pup. The cloth's by the door. | That's honest, at least.

rule f7_st_pc_sweet
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=sweet other.stage=young
does ack
priority 1
say That's my pup. | Come here. | Good pup.

rule f7_st_pc_sweet_teen
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=sweet other.stage=adolescent
does ack
priority 1
say You're a good one. Better than you know. | Come here. I'm allowed one hug. | Thank you. I mean it.

rule f7_st_pc_sweet_adult
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=sweet other.stage=adult|old
does ack
priority 1
say You're a good one. You always were. | Look at you. Grown, and still my pup. | Well. We'll see.

rule f7_st_pc_sad
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=sad
does ack
priority 1
say Come here. Just come here. | I'm here. I'm right here. | Hush now. I've got you.

rule f7_st_pc_eager
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=eager
does ack
priority 1
say Sit close, then. | Every word of it. Near enough. | Well. It was a long time ago...

rule f7_st_pc_doubt
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_tone=doubt
does ack
priority 1
say Think on it. That's all I ask. | We'll talk again. | I only want you happy.

rule f7_st_pc_food
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_pc=food
does ack
priority 3
say Eat. All of it. | I'm sure. Eat. | Half each, then. Small half for me.

rule f7_st_pc_goodbye
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_pc=goodbye
does ack
priority 3
say Not today. Be good. | I'll bring you a crust if you're good. | Bar the door, now.

rule f7_st_pc_bed
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_pc=bed
does ack
priority 3
say Sleep. | Goodnight, pup. | Not one more word.

rule f7_st_pc_master
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_pc=master
does ack
priority 3
say Keep at it. It comes. | That's how we all learned. | Mind them, and mind your paws.

rule f7_st_pc_late
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_pc=late
does ack
priority 3
say Next time, home by dark. | A friend. With a name, I hope. | We'll talk in the morning. Bed.

rule f7_st_pc_earn
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_pc=earn
does ack
priority 3
say You're a good one. Better than we deserve. | I'm proud of you. I hate it, but I'm proud. | Only till things turn. I promise.

rule f7_st_pc_ask_teen
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_pc=ask_teen
does ack
priority 3
say All right. I'm here, whenever you want. | That's not an answer, but I'll take it. | You know where I am.

rule f7_st_pc_grandpups
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_pc=grandpups
does ack
priority 3
say I'm only saying. | Well. Don't leave it too long. | I'll keep knitting, then.

rule f7_st_pc_grandpup
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_pc=grandpup
does ack
priority 3
say Spoil them? Me? | Restday. I'll bake. | Bring them hungry.

rule f7_st_pc_lonely
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_pc=lonely
does ack
priority 3
say Maybe. Maybe I will. | They always said you were the kind one. | You're good to your old parent.

rule f7_st_pc_hurt
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_pc=hurt
does ack
priority 3
say Fuss, fuss. | Oh, very well. | You're as bad as I am.

rule f7_st_pc_help
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=pc conv.f7_pc=help
does ack
priority 3
say You'll take it and hush. | It's not charity. It's family. | Pay me back with a visit.

# A son's or daughter's last word, after their mother or father answers.

rule f7_st_cp_fob
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_tone=fob self.stage=young
does ack
priority 1
say That's not an answer! | Hmph. | I'll ask #gran#.

rule f7_st_cp_fob_teen
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_tone=fob self.stage=adolescent
does ack
priority 1
say That means no. | Ugh. Fine. | You always say that.

rule f7_st_cp_fob_adult
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_tone=fob self.stage=adult|old
does ack
priority 1
say Humour me. | I'll fuss if I like. | You'd do the same for me.

rule f7_st_cp_play
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_tone=play self.stage=young
does ack
priority 1
say That's silly! | *giggles* No it isn't! | You're making it up!

rule f7_st_cp_play_teen
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_tone=play self.stage=adolescent
does ack
priority 1
say Stop it. Please. People are looking. | I'm leaving. I'm actually leaving. | You're the worst. The very worst.

rule f7_st_cp_sharp
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_tone=sharp self.stage=young
does ack
priority 1
say Aww. | It's not fair. | Hmph.

rule f7_st_cp_sharp_teen
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_tone=sharp self.stage=adolescent
does ack
priority 1
say You never let me do anything! | Fine! | You don't understand. You never understand.

rule f7_st_cp_sharp_adult
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_tone=sharp self.stage=adult|old
does ack
priority 1
say Stubborn as ever. | You're impossible. | Fine. I'm coming Restday anyway.

rule f7_st_cp_eager
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_tone=eager
does ack
priority 1
say Tell me! All of it! | Is it a long one? Good! | I'm listening! I'm all ears!

rule f7_st_cp_tale
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_tone=tale
does ack
priority 1
say What did you do? Tell me! | Worse than me? Really? | I don't believe you.

rule f7_st_cp_kind
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_tone=kind
does ack
priority 1
say #bc_thank_you# | All right. | Can I have a cuddle?

rule f7_st_cp_kind_teen
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_tone=kind self.stage=adolescent
does ack
priority 1
say Thank you! I'll be careful! | Really? Truly? | You're the best. Don't tell anyone I said that.

rule f7_st_cp_hungry
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_cp=hungry
does ack
priority 3
say Thank you! | Can I have the crust? | I'll eat slowly. To make it last.

rule f7_st_cp_fear
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_cp=fear
does ack ask.detail
priority 3
say Promise? | Can you leave the candle? | ...Is it really the wind?

rule f7_st_cp_want_yes
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_cp=want conv.f7_tone=kind
does ack
priority 3
say Thank you! Thank you! | I'll be good! I'll be so good! | You're the best!

rule f7_st_cp_news
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_cp=news conv.f7_tone=kind
does ack
priority 3
say Look! Look now! | I'll show you again! Watch! | I'm going to show everyone.

rule f7_st_cp_leave
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_cp=leave
does ack
priority 3
say One day. You'll see. | You can't keep me forever. | I'll write. I will.

rule f7_st_cp_cramped
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_cp=cramped
does ack
priority 3
say I mean it. All of us. | Hmph. Warm. | A curtain. A real one.

rule f7_st_cp_help
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_cp=help
does ack
priority 3
say Family doesn't keep accounts. | Then take it for me. So I sleep at night. | Too late. It's done.

rule f7_st_cp_gran
when concept=family.settle conv.f7_chain=cp conv.f7_cp=gran conv.f7_tone=kind
does ack
priority 3
say Thank you! | Hooray! | Please, please, please!
